    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991520/extras/b3297d1f7bf795cfc8dd6bc54de34e3b.poster.avif?t=1735947430\" width=638 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991520/extras/b3297d1f7bf795cfc8dd6bc54de34e3b.webm?t=1735947430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991520/extras/b3297d1f7bf795cfc8dd6bc54de34e3b.mp4?t=1735947430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Boy With Amnesia Wandering Around In Search Of Answers</h2>-Loop is an immersive 2.5D game experience that was created to give you an entirely <strong>unique and stylized 3D painting environment</strong>. Set in a surreal world, you can explore a variety of landscapes, with stunning visuals and captivating music, you will be pulled into the world of Loop. <br>-Game <strong>unique puzzles and levels</strong> provide an interesting and engaging experience that will keep you on your toes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991520/extras/bcae7bf1e64ee4c308dabb8fd14a8844.poster.avif?t=1735947430\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991520/extras/bcae7bf1e64ee4c308dabb8fd14a8844.webm?t=1735947430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991520/extras/bcae7bf1e64ee4c308dabb8fd14a8844.mp4?t=1735947430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Loop is an adventure game that will take you on an <strong>unforgettable journey</strong>. With a story full of mystery and secrets, you\u2019ll be taken on a thrilling ride filled with unexpected plot twists and challenging puzzles. Loop is an adventure that will keep you guessing until the very end. So go ahead and take the plunge, and explore the mysterious world of Loop",
